From: Akisaira <akisaira@outlook.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: gaokun3: vreg_l9d常开

这份设备树里只有usb_0_qmpphy（vdda-pll）用到vreg_l9d（0.912V），可依赖这路
电的不止这一个PHY：Windows的PEP给URS0（port0）、USB2（多口控制器）和PCI2–6
都投了LDO9_D 912mV的票，这些用电方设备树里都没有写。于是combo PHY一退出，
l9d就断电。usb_0在device模式下系统挂起时，dwc3_core_exit会让它退出；UCSI
工作以后，切换插头方向、切换DP模式也会。断电的后果：

- usb_0在device模式下挂起时，整板复位（案卷#52）；
- port0的dwc3软复位超时（-110），xhci和gadget都起不来，直到重启（#27一类
  现象，0048里记的就是它）；同一时刻，多口控制器（a400000）上的笔MCU
  （usb 3-3）掉线。

改成常开以后，这些情况下l9d都不再断电。

没有改用主线的接法（把usb_0_hsphy的vdda-pll也接到l9d上）：device模式挂起时
port0的两个PHY都会退出，l9d照样会断，而PCIe和多口控制器那时还在用它。

这里的用电映射来自linux-gaokun的20445ba（"dts: add temporarily dts"）。
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dts
@@ -593,6 +593,17 @@
 			regulator-min-microvolt = <912000>;
 			regulator-max-microvolt = <912000>;
 			regulator-initial-mode = <RPMH_REGULATOR_MODE_HPM>;
+			/*
+			 * usb_0_qmpphy is its only consumer here, but port0's
+			 * USB2 side, the multiport controller and PCIe need it
+			 * too: the Windows PEP votes LDO9_D for URS0, USB2 and
+			 * PCI2-6. Without this, every combo PHY exit
+			 * (orientation or mode switch, device-mode suspend)
+			 * turns it off; port0's dwc3 then fails to soft-reset
+			 * (-110), and suspending with usb_0 in device mode
+			 * resets the board.
+			 */
+			regulator-always-on;
 			// HACK: wrongly voting for LPM may block DP Alt
 			// regulator-allow-set-load;
 			// regulator-allowed-modes = <RPMH_REGULATOR_MODE_LPM
